                <pb facs="0132" n="92" sameAs="frus:frus1865p1/pg92"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office United States Military
                            Telegraph</hi>. <hi rendition="#italic">War
                    Department.</hi></placeName></opener>
                <p>The following telegram received at Washington 8. 20 p. m., January 14, 1865, from
                    Montreal, January 14, 1865.</p>
                <p>The proceedings against St. Albans felons were adjourned thirty (30) days to
                    allow them to send to Richmond for evidence that they were acting under the
                    authority of Jeff. Davis. I sent full despatch per mail on the 8th.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN F. POTTER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
